note = "In Adobe Garamond, Regular weight, the stem of the b is 7.76 percent wider in roman than in italic.

Light upright curved stem of a: 114. straight stem 110.

Central slant. curved stem of a: 106. straight stem 104.

Slanted: curved stem of a 102. straight stem 95.

Letterspacer params: Area 280, Depth 20, Over 0

If a long vertical (e.g. l) looks too thick, reduce to 0.96 (already done for Master 3).

Order of vertical stems: lc straight, lc round, uc straight, uc round

Order of horizontal stems: o top, O top, H bar.
";
